# The deny list scripts/scan-sensitive adds to .gitleaks.toml. Copy it to
# sensitive-patterns in the main checkout (gitignored; worktrees read it from
# there) and replace these placeholders, which match nothing, with your own
# account-number shapes. One RE2 regex per line; blank and # lines are skipped.
# A finding names the line number, never the value.

# One bank account, with or without the dashes a statement prints.
\b999-?99-?999999-?9\b

# Every account at one branch: its fixed prefix, then any digits.
\b9999\d{8}\b
